flowchart TD
    START([Incoming request]) --> LOAD[Load bucket state from Redis<br/>tokens, last_refill_ts]
    LOAD --> REFILL[Refill tokens:<br/>tokens += elapsed × rate<br/>cap at burst size]
    REFILL --> CHECK{tokens >= 1?}
    CHECK -->|Yes| DEC[Decrement 1 token<br/>persist to Redis]
    DEC --> ALLOW([Allow request<br/>return remaining])
    CHECK -->|No| DENY([Deny request<br/>return retry_after])
    DENY --> R429[Gateway returns 429]

    style ALLOW fill:#e0ffe0
    style DENY fill:#ffe0e0
